#### National_CF-3300 data disk (no DOS)
== S5 ('23:')  pc=0D6A curlin=0000 mode=S1
   |  Enter date ( - - ):10 FOR I=0
   |   TO 19:REA
   |  Invalid date
   |  Enter date ( - - ):20 DEFUSR=
   |  &HC000:X=U
   |  Invalid date
   |  Enter date ( - - ):30 DATA 20
#### C-BIOS_MSX1_EU_REPACK_DISK data disk (no DOS)
== S5 ('23:')  pc=0251 curlin=FFFF mode=S0
   |  zerobas version 0.1
   |  clean-room MSX1 BASIC
   |  zerobas Disk BASIC
   |  ZB
   |  10 FOR I=0 TO 19:READ A:POKE &HC000+I
   |  ,A:NEXT
   |  20 DEFUSR=&HC000:X=USR(0):PRINT "R";H
   |  EX$(PEEK(&HC020));" ";HEX$(PEEK(&HC02
   |  1))
   |  30 DATA 2
   |  color  auto   goto   list   run
